//- The release this board is RUNNING has been withdrawn. The update check has
//- worked this out since withdrawal existed and nothing showed it; a board on a
//- pulled release read exactly like one that was current.
//- Needs: result (a check result, judged against what is running), running.
if result && result.channels
  - var gone = null
  each chan in result.channels
    if chan && chan.withdrawn && !gone
      - gone = chan.withdrawn
  if gone
    .alert.alert-danger(data-withdrawn=running)
      strong #{running} has been withdrawn.
      if gone.reason
        |  #{gone.reason}.
      if gone.by
        |  #{gone.by} replaces it.
      else
        |  No replacement is published yet; stay on #{running} until one is.
